  <para style="h">Qiesalonijia Kunlade Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Qiesalonijia Kunlade Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Qiesalonijia</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Qie</para>
  <para style="mt">Qiesalonijia Kunlade Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char>, <char style="pn">Seila</char>, <char style="pn">Qimotai</char> ghurulie mai Ada Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai miendedu <char style="png">Qiesalonijia</char>i jiohuide xin huaizho. <verse eid="2TH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Mai Ada Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha tande nenjien, pinnan ogi gie!<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ersa Mexiha Pse Irezhi Panjine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Gaijiula, bijien tande oluzhi Hudade chan mafan kieliese indanji wo. Tai xianxin gieku zhughe fugiedazhi, nieniedene oreku zhugheye olodozho. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Bijien Hudai jiohuilade tai kuaizhi kieliezho. Ta olon heiku, kunnanni penjikude rennai giezho, xianxin giekuni goude bareizho. <verse eid="2TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Eneshi Huda gundande panjikui zhenmin giezho. Hudai gojiade oluzhi tai shouku gieghazhi Hudai gojiade peighane giezho. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Hudashi gundanni wo. Tai biisan kunlai Huda biikughala bouin giene. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>Ta shouku giesan kunlai bijienre hhantu pinnanshighane. Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> nenlitu qienxienghalane asiman jierese khan dunda xienjikude <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>Hudai tani dasan kun, mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni gouxioxini ulie shunjichen kunlai faine. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Ezhan enelai faizhi meliesene, famatu nenlisene likai gieghadene chanqi widaghane. <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>Ezhan ireku hhe udude hhei shentula, jien xianxin giesan kunla man hhei ghudure wo giezhi kuaine. Taye hhelai dunda wine. Bijien ganzhen beisanyi ta xianxin giewo. <verse eid="2TH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Enende oluzhi bijien tande chan onxian giezho. Mai Huda tai urusan mujide tai peigha gie. Huda nenlighalane tai gounide olusan duran, pse xianxin giekughala giesan wilielani man chengun olugha gie. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Ingiese mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i niere zhao mai Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai nenjienghala tai jiere famashine, taye hhei jiere famashine.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Fugie Zuitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Gaijiula, mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha pse irekude, matan hhei melie hhantulakude oluzhi tai xiahua giezhi kielieye. <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>Ezhanni udu ijin kuzhewo giezhi kunla kieliese ta suibien bu gojioluzhi bu jinda. Hhelade kenen Shenlin mejieghazho, loushila jianjizho, pse shitulai xin wo giezhi maochun giene. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Hhela yan banfaghala piendaliuzhe goyane bu piendagha. Hhe uduse melie panjio gieku shiqin wine. Pse zuihoude widaku hhe fugie zuitu xienjizhi khizhene. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Hhe irese kunla huda wo giezhi urusanlase, kunla beiisan shihenilase duizhi goyane hhelase fugiede uzhene, da mechide souzhi goyane Huda wo giene.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Bi tanre hhantu bikude kieliesan ene shiqinlani ta jila danu? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Ede hhe fugie zuituni yan duisei ta mejiene. Shihouni kuzhese hhei xienjizhi khizheghane. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Hhe fugie zuitu ijin jizide wilie giezho. Duisan hhe widatula ingiezhi giene. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Ingiedene hhe fugie zuitu xienji khizhene. Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> amanne hoghala hhei widaghane, ireku gonqighala hhei fugughane. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Hhe fugie zuitu irese Ibilisini wiliei giezhi yanyanji nenlitu shiqin, ghudureqi, jia fugie shiqin giene. <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>Pse widaku kunlai jiere yanyanji gou wini piendaku shiqinlai giene. Enela jiuiku zhendaode xiqi wizhi ese jienliezho. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Ene yenyin jiere Huda hhelade codaku zhughe olon ogizhi jiani xianxin gieghawo. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Ingiedene zhendaoni xianxin uye giezhi gou winide xiqi bisan hhe kunlade man zui jinjine.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Huda Tai Sunghuzhi Jiuiwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Ezhan oresan gaijiula, tande oluzhi bijien Hudade chan mafan kieliekuni wo. Huda eqighanse tai sunghuzhi Shenlinghala zhiguishighadene zhendaoni xianxin gieghazhi tai jiuiwo. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Bijien chonjisan gouxioxighala Huda tai uruzhi jiuiwo. Ingiese mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani famai tande ireghane giezho.<verse eid="2TH 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Ingiese gaijiula, ta beizhi undanla. Bijien kielien, xinghala tande sughasan daolini ta goude barei.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha goyane, matande orezhi nenjienghalane mai chanqi sidaghazhi kieliesan, pse gou xiwon ogisan mai Ada Hudaghala <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>tai sidaghazhi kielie gie. Pse ta shiheni gou wilie giezhi gou kielien kieliekude tande nenli ogi gie.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Bijiende Onxian Gie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Gaijiula, zuihoude kielieye, ta bijiende ingiezhi onxian gie, tai dundashiku mutun Ezhanyi kielienyi gochude ghujighan chonji keidene famashigha gie. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Mouxien kun, doghun kunlase bijienyi jiui gie. Ene xinyanshi dajianughun pusho. <verse eid="2TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Ezhanshi kekaoni wo, tai khiduzheghazhi doghunnise bouine. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Bijien Ezhanyi miende tai xianxin giezho. Bijien tande fenfulasanyi ta giezho, ihouye giene.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Ezhan tai zhughei uduruzhi Hudai orekude, Mexihani rennai giekude echigha gie!<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Goude Wilie Giezhi Udu Dao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Gaijiula, mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani niereghala tande minlin xiaiye, langande giezhi bijien chonjisan daolini ulie zunjisan gaijiulase gholodo. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Bijienyi daghazhi indan matui giekuni ta goyane mejiene. Bijien tai dunda bikude langanrazhi ese giezho. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Kunlai budanyi belien ese ijiezho. Tande achan ulie ogine giezhi xieni udu wilie giezhi khishulazhi ku shouizho. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Eneshi bijiende qienli wikuni pusho, taye bijien mutun gie giezhi bijien tande yanzi uzheghawo. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Bijien tai hhende bikude kien wilie ulie giene giese budan bu ijie giezhi tande minlin xiaizhi daowo. <verse eid="2TH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Bijien chenliese tai dunda niezhan kunla langanrazhi wilie ulie giene. Da ulie gonjiku shiqinyi gonjine. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Bijien Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani miende ene izhun kunlade minlin xiaizhi sughazhi kielieye, undande wilie giezhi goya budanne ijie. <verse eid="2TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Gaijiula, ta gouni giekude zhughene bu sularagha.<verse eid="2TH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Kien bijienni ene xin jieredu kielienyi ulie chenliese hhei zhiidene laiwon bu giezhi shizhegha. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Ingieliuzhe hhei duitou bu danlagha. Gaijiune mutun uzhezhi sughazhi kielie.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Pinnan ogisan Ezhan qinsi yan shiqindeliuzhe suishisui tande pinnan ogi gie. Ezhan chan ta ashighalare hhantu bi gie!<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Bi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> qinsi huaizhi kielien asazho. Mini alinie xin jiereliuzhe bi nierene ingiezhi huaizhi hao giezho. <verse eid="2TH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani nenjien tanre man hhantu bi gie!<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
